.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
schemas/json-schema/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/*.lock

# Matt Pocock's engineering skills are installed as a user-scope Claude Code plugin
# (mattpocock-skills@mattpocock), not vendored here. Install with:
#   claude plugin marketplace add mattpocock/skills
#   claude plugin install mattpocock-skills@mattpocock
# docs/agents/ is that skill set's per-repo config (issue tracker, triage labels, domain
# docs); CLAUDE.local.md is the pointer to it that the skills read. Both are machine-local.
docs/agents/
CLAUDE.local.md
